ednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "and we're the odd ones?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10314.79, "timestamp": "02:51:54", "text": "东西。”嗯，印第安人的侮辱性言论之类的东西，还有"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10317.896, "timestamp": "02:51:57", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "wtf"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10318.63, "timestamp": "02:51:58", "text": "我当时就想，“这到底是怎么回事？”我从没说过"}]